      "STORE CLERK: May I help you find something?\nCAROL: I’m not sure.\nCAROL: I just want to be sure I’m getting enough of everything.\nSTORE CLERK: Are you taking supplements now?",
      "SALLY: Let’s just have the maximum shot count be ten, for Christ’s sake.\nCAROL: The shot count is however many strokes it took you to get the ball in the hole.\nSALLY: Golf talk is so sexual-sounding isn’t it? Balls, holes, strokes...\nCAROL: Just count up your shots, Sally. And be honest.",
